    "Excluded: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "已排除：%@" }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export hands the archive to the share sheet, and SandboxArk cannot tell whether the export finished. SandboxArk keeps its own copy in temporary storage, which the system may reclaim at any time; your next backup replaces it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "导出会把归档交给分享面板，SandboxArk 无法得知导出是否完成。SandboxArk 自己的副本放在临时存储里，系统随时可能回收它；下一次备份会替换这份副本。" }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exported. Keep the exported copy: SandboxArk's own copy is temporary and your next backup replaces it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "已导出。请保留导出的副本：SandboxArk 自己的副本是临时的，下一次备份会替换它。" }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export…" : {
